documentation_complete: true

title: 'Require the Latest Version of Packages'

description: |-
    Whether the checks of installed packages also require that the
    configured repositories offer no newer version of the package, as
    <tt>apt list --upgradable</tt> reports from the local package lists.
    CIS Ubuntu 20.04 v3.0.0 requires the latest versions of the AppArmor
    packages.

type: boolean

operator: equals

interactive: false

options:
    default: false
    false: false
    true: true
